    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35648" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνθύ̄μ-ησις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>consideration, esteem,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				246
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>consideration, reflection,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.132
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Matt.</u>
				9.4
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Sm.
				<u>Jb.</u>
				21.27
			</span></i>, Vett. Val.<i><span class="en">
				301.8
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>idea, conception,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς ἐ. ἐσθήτων ἦλθον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Diog.
				</span></i>
			 Oen.<i><span class="en">
				10
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς ἐ. ὀξύς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Salt.</u>
					81
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>anxiety, worry,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Praec.</u>
				4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>resolution</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				1024 iv 12
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iv A. D.)</span>.</div>
